---
layout: base.njk
title: Projects
nav: projects
permalink: /projects/
description: "Selected engineering, design, and manufacturing projects from VCLV."
---
<div class="wrap-wide">
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p>Engineering, design, and manufacturing work — from robotic large-format printing to reverse-engineered glass grinding.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for project in collections.projects %}
    <a class="project-card" href="{{ project.url }}">
      <div class="project-card-media">
        <img src="{{ project.data.hero }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="project-card-body">
        <p class="project-card-title">{{ project.data.title }}</p>
        <p class="project-card-excerpt">{{ project.data.summary }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
